      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "An analysis of physical exercise tolerance in CHD patients with the equal number of affected coronary arteries with relation to a coronary bed region involved in a pathological process, showed that its decrease was mostly pronounced in vasoconstriction of the left coronary arterial system and was determined by a decrease in the blood flow in this region."},
